<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training and neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in the Lake Chad area while the military chief held high-level talks with Rwanda Defence Force leadership. The United Nations Security Council renewed the MINUSCA mandate to 2027 and reduced the troop ceiling to 12,000, planning a gradual drawdown of peacekeepers as the transition plan gathers pace. UN officials are cutting the CAR peacekeeping force in line with the new mandate. The conflict produced 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOektTWm5zeGNDWjVnc1dlaFY3R3RUdE02VlBQT2hYVWEzcUdtcjFyZi1TTkxpRmtUVkVsemk2ZWFOZGRERC1oV3ZpQXJDLTdNOF90UnBWa010Q19iUmcwY0d6eXJHZUVJQ2Q5bkhuc1FlNUZ6anVldWJlSGFkT1pYWU9OWTlCdGJ5OXlpNWdhRHlxeTRfa0F4dkFDODU4S1pSUEszcnpMWVl1bXJPN3dvRVRIV3BibWpkVlV0Z3J6RS1ERU5Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPbThTTlBhYVhabHBFajQxczZEbFBHT3lxdHlYS3JPYkFKbVdnRFg0U3EtZjFCajlvdlBvbGJyX2RTc3Q4emxHbV9jV0tDdE5TLVdHZ0p1NU5ZTE5QWTRrWXNoTHl2cXdqb3hFM1dXd2c3UUxfYXl2c3VRRUtHNU1vSVBBWTY4VDRTaGxkRllsWWtUeXpPdDZQb1EyMGV6aXJ1V01Mc1FESmxSTWZMblJwRmxsMTc1WWVNUTBBdkFPcFN5dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOaTRacm5UWXJ1Qm14bzl6X2hIdGVPbDdUYm1QbktJWG9HU2trWHlPVHJZaUlMR19XZ0tTMU1qLXBxVk05UjB4YlJ1dXZJWFN4UEZHU0M0YmNzRzdiRjF4cDZKY3pHMUtnN2pkS3U1VlBuMHFGSlJFdXh5bllrdkgxMzF4QWZfVVAxMkxSUzdPYlRZdC1VVTg1aVcxM3pKNHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNQ0NGUTJJVWEwNlR2NnVLVTdLWE5Lb1ROZVk0UW5kaU5sQ2dBeWRGWHRLaVZFb01iUXhKTE9Jd